{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/kempinski-residences-swiss-property-al-jaddaf","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":471,"crm_id":"132","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Kempinski Residences","slug":"kempinski-residences-swiss-property-al-jaddaf","display_address":"Al Jaddaf","building_type":["apartment","duplex","branded"],"completion_year":"Ready","developer":"Swiss Property","price":2200000,"display_price":"2.2M","lattitude":25.2159307,"longitude":55.3258904,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Kempinski Residences The Creek, <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/al-jaddaf/\">Al Jaddaf</a> is an exclusive residential project by Swiss Property, developed in partnership with the prestigious five-star hotel group, Kempinski Hotels. It offers a collection of elegantly designed <strong>1 to 3-bedroom apartments and 2 to 4-bedroom duplexes</strong>, crafted to deliver a refined living experience. Kempinski Residences The Creek comprises two elegant towers linked by a serene, triple-height lobby inspired by Zen design. The development features a comprehensive suite of amenities, including a climate-controlled swimming pool, advanced fitness centre, yoga studio, private cinema, and more.</p><p>Situated in the picturesque Al Jaddaf area along the Dubai Canal, Kempinski Residences The Creek enjoys a strategic location with seamless access to key districts across the city. Within walking distance, residents can explore a wide selection of cafés, dining venues, supermarkets, retail outlets, schools, nurseries, and healthcare centres.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Kempinski_Residences_The_Creek_Al_Jaddaf_21ae553dc1.jpg","hash":"Kempinski_Residences_The_Creek_Al_Jaddaf_21