s: Children’s play areas, a splash pool, kids’ club, and entertainment spaces ensure families are catered to with care and attention.</li><li>Connected Waterfront Living: Situated in the thriving Al Jaddaf community within Dubai Healthcare City Phase 2, offering quick access to key destinations like Downtown Dubai and Dubai Festival City.</li><li>Exclusive Resident Privileges: Homeowners receive Kempinski Discovery Membership along with dining and spa discounts for a complete luxury lifestyle.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1546,"cta":{"id":2330,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Kempinski_Residences_The_Creek_Al_Jaddaf_907066be28.jpg","hash":"Kempinski_Residences_The_Creek_Al_Jaddaf_907066be28","name":"Kempinski Residences The Creek, Al Jaddaf "},"style":null,"title":"An Ideal Location Offering Breathtaking Water Views","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Kempinski Residences is located within the thriving Al Jaddaf district. Set along the serene waterfront of Dubai Creek, the development offers residents sweeping vistas of the city’s most iconic landmarks. From the majestic Burj Khalifa and vibrant Creek Harbour to the peaceful Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary, every view reflects the tranquil elegance of this contemporary address. Nestled in Al Jaddaf—one of Dubai’s most promising waterfront communities—the residences offer the ideal balance of connectivity and serenity.</p><ul><li>Dubai Creek Harbour – 10 minutes</li><li>Ras Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary – 12 minutes</li><li>Dubai Frame – 15 minutes</li><li>Dubai Festival City Mall – 10 minutes</li><li>Downtown Dubai (Burj Khalifa &amp; Dubai Mall) – 20 minutes</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":2970,"url":"https://ggfx-providentes